OL,3,AWilliam and Kate meet Indian Prime
OL,4,AMinister Modi in New Delhi
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales have
OL,7,Fmet Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi
OL,8,Fas part of their three-day visit to
OL,9,FIndia.
OL,11,FWilliam and Catherine arrived in New
OL,12,FDehli on Wednesday for the final leg of
OL,13,Ftheir first official oversees trip
OL,14,Ftogether in four years.
OL,16,FThe meeting was a late addition to the
OL,17,Fcouple's schedule and came after Modi
OL,18,Fconfirmed he would be back from a
OL,19,Fscheduled trip to the Philippines in
OL,20,Ftime to see the royals.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
